## Three-file contract (what each side may touch)

| File | Role | Who edits |
|---|---|---|
| `dod.json` + `03_auto_research/dod_eval.py` | the immutable judge (Karpathy `prepare.py`) | nobody — frozen |
| `product/` | the agent-modifiable implementation (Karpathy `train.py`) | developer |
| `program.md` (this file) | the human/architect direction (Karpathy `program.md`) | architect |

